}

R571 --> N : exact fold theorem\nfinite fold closed
R650 --> N : producer-strategy status\nlegacy cut retired\nClay false
N --> TOE
N --> U
N --> P
TOE --> V
U --> V
P --> V
V --> E

note right of N
Preconditions:
- R571 owner exists
- canonical NS paper interface exists

Invariants:
- no theorem promotion
- finite fold != physical inhabitance
- producer strategy != Clay obligation
- A/B/C/D separation
- no ESD mutation

Postconditions:
- fold theorem reachable
- samplewise payment remains analytic
- Galerkin fold remains analytic
- old PDF B1-B4/B7 not mandatory
- Clay promotion remains false
end note
@enduml
